            </h3>

            <p>
              My work sits between engineering design and software. I enjoy
              understanding a workflow deeply and then finding the algorithm
              that can make it faster, cleaner and more repeatable.
            </p>

          </article>


          <article class="story-card">

            <span class="card-number">02</span>

            <h3>
              Geometry<br />
              is the language
            </h3>

            <p>
              CAD and BIM problems often begin with points, curves, surfaces,
              intersections and constraints. I like turning those pieces into
