              Whether it is a BIM automation problem, a CAD plugin,
              computational geometry or a software idea — let's talk.
            </p>


            <a
              class="big-link"
              href="mailto:YOUR_EMAIL@example.com"
            >
              YOUR_EMAIL@example.com
              <span>↗</span>
            </a>


            <div class="contact-row">

              <a href="#">
                LinkedIn
              </a>

              <a href="#">
                GitHub
              </a>

              <a href="#">
                Download CV
              </a>

